!include ../_style.puml

title QA提問狀態機圖

[*] --> validating : askQuestion / normalize input and scope
validating --> failed : authorizationError [scope invalid] / reject request
validating --> retrieving : authorizationPassed / FAQ or vector search
retrieving --> no_match : retrievalComplete [no usable evidence] / build no-answer
retrieving --> generating : retrievalComplete [evidence available] / assemble citations
generating --> answered : generationSuccess [citations valid] / record answer
generating --> no_match : generationSuccess [insufficient answer] / record no-answer
generating --> failed : providerError [not safely recoverable] / record failure
answered --> [*] : responseSent / expose answerStatus and citations
no_match --> [*] : responseSent / expose explicit no-answer
failed --> [*] : errorSent / expose retryable or terminal error

note right of retrieving
  對應設計類別：Question。
  FAQ 命中仍須重驗 citation allowlist；空 scope 不得退回全資料搜尋。
end note

@enduml
